{"schema":"hs-fair-price-receipt-batch-v1","date":"2026-10-25","count":1,"store":"https://mcp.horizonshield.dev/ledger/","records":[{"sha":"416274471db6d72517b8069115d4bf00e7be136cd81eb71cff1bef1456cbbfb5"}],"note":"Each sha is the SHA-256(JSON.stringify(claim)) of a HORIZON SHIELD fair-price receipt issued on this UTC day, served at store + sha and copied in horizon-shield ops/receipts/<date>.json. This entry's Bitcoin anchor bounds every listed receipt from above. It says the receipt existed; it does not say the price is right."}